/** @namespace ShaderCompiler
	@brief Offline shader preprocessing tool, see @ref shader-compiler

	Shared with the game at runtime: the reflection types the tool writes into the generated shader
	headers (`Sources/Shaders/Generated`) live in this namespace as well, and that is how the backends
	of @ref nCine::RHI learn the uniforms and vertex inputs of a compiled shader.
*/

